description:
GPT-6 Astra has reached 99.9% on ARC-AGI-3, alongside a 100% score on ExploitBench, according to OpenAI. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}

The announcement matters because Astra is not only being evaluated on abstract reasoning. OpenAI says the model also sets new benchmarks for computer use, software engineering, cybersecurity, science, and professional work. Greg Brockman has suggested this could mark the beginning of the AGI era, although the broader question is whether benchmark results translate into general intelligence outside controlled evaluations. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}

